  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/29d39c0221e4a8c13fc614337514ba514156d893</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/gentoo-zh/overlay/commit/29d39c0221e4a8c13fc614337514ba514156d893"/>
    <title>
        net-im/wechat: add 4.1.13.9-r2, drop 4.1.13.9-r1
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-09T15:24:19Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9402092?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>locez</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/locez</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;net-im/wechat: add 4.1.13.9-r2, drop 4.1.13.9-r1

因为需要通过 Wayland 的 text-input-v3 协议接收输入法事件，所以在普通和
Bubblewrap 启动器的 Wayland 分支中设置 `QT_IM_MODULE=text-input-unstable-v3`。

Signed-off-by: Locez &amp;lt;locez@locez.com&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/e262344b18c8739510c8419d6fedd5abdfe7b793</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/gentoo-zh/overlay/commit/e262344b18c8739510c8419d6fedd5abdfe7b793"/>
    <title>
        net-proxy/yacd-meta: add 0.4.0, drop 0.3.8
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-09T14:56:21Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221879664?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Zakkaus</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Zakkaus</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;net-proxy/yacd-meta: add 0.4.0, drop 0.3.8

因为上游这版改用 bun，gentoo-zh/gentoo-deps 的 generator 用 npm 会因 overrides
冲突报 EOVERRIDE、用 pnpm 会因 packageManager 字段报 ERR_PNPM_OTHER_PM_EXPECTED，
两条路都产不出 node_modules，所以改由 gentoo-zh-drafts/yacd-meta 自动镜像产出。

Signed-off-by: Zakk &amp;lt;zakk@gentoozh.org&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/7efa21af61387394c1b92930ac28d96ffe5a00b7</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/gentoo-zh/overlay/commit/7efa21af61387394c1b92930ac28d96ffe5a00b7"/>
    <title>
        sys-apps/pnpm: restrict tests
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-09T14:12:41Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221879664?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Zakkaus</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Zakkaus</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;sys-apps/pnpm: restrict tests

因为 cargo_src_test 跑的是整个 workspace，其中三个 dialoguer 提示测试在非交互
stdin 上会永远阻塞，另有十二个 audit/list/view 渲染测试比对终端排版输出，在构建
沙盒里必然失败。

Signed-off-by: Zakk &amp;lt;zakk@gentoozh.org&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/9c7d237957ad16d1ce23689194c61243768d4a3b</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/gentoo-zh/overlay/commit/9c7d237957ad16d1ce23689194c61243768d4a3b"/>
    <title>
        app-text/lektra: suggest the optional runtime libraries
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-09T14:10:30Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221879664?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Zakkaus</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Zakkaus</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;app-text/lektra: suggest the optional runtime libraries

因为 src/Model.cpp 用 QLibrary 在运行时加载 librsvg、cairo、djvulibre 和
libexif，所以用 optfeature 提示。

Signed-off-by: Zakk &amp;lt;zakk@gentoozh.org&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/6849e4e669b9d8d9d478d3ddbe74a727c790af79</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/gentoo-zh/overlay/commit/6849e4e669b9d8d9d478d3ddbe74a727c790af79"/>
    <title>
        app-text/lektra: add 0.7.7, drop 0.7.6
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-09T14:10:30Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221879664?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>Zakkaus</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/Zakkaus</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;app-text/lektra: add 0.7.7, drop 0.7.6

因为上游这版的 release tag 去掉了 v 前缀，所以 SRC_URI 改用 ${PV}；mupdf
submodule 指向 1.28.2，MUPDF_PV 跟着更新。

Signed-off-by: Zakk &amp;lt;zakk@gentoozh.org&amp;gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
